  This repository contains no file and no copied code of RT-DETRv4. The node downloads RT-DETRv4's source at a fixed
  commit and its checkpoints into its cache directory (~/.cache/xblick/rtdetrv4) and runs the source there to make
  an ONNX file from a checkpoint. src/xblick_rtdetrv4/export.py follows the steps of RT-DETRv4's
  tools/deployment/export_onnx.py and is written anew. The pre- and post-processing in src/xblick_rtdetrv4/model.py
  follow the input and output format of that export and RT-DETRv4's evaluation transforms; they are written anew in
  numpy. The 80 class names are those of the COCO dataset.
- The checkpoints were trained with Meta's DINOv3 as a teacher (DINOv3 License,
  github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3). DINOv3 itself is neither part of this repository nor downloaded or run by
  the node. README.md, "Requirements", states what is known about the checkpoints' terms.
- ONNX Runtime by Microsoft, MIT License. It is a Python dependency. PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause) and the packages of the
  extra export are Python dependencies of the export only.
